\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Lethal Lissy is one of the pirates who constantly tries to loot Liberty Bay with overwhelming invasions of pirates. If you see her around Liberty Bay, it's not a good sign.\n</p>\n<p>\nYou get a chance to kill her in the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a> after killing <b>3000 pirates</b> for <a href=\"#/wiki/Raymond%20Striker\">Raymond Striker</a>. The teleporter is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31977,32853,1\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31977, 32853, 1)</a>.<br/></p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Lethal Lissy\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"126\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lethal_Lissy_Killing_in_the_Name_of_Quest_467e66.png\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Lethal Lissy</p> </figcaption> </figure><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-160)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (150)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-spac